        value: 'Fade(stay,0.01,#FFFFFF);

          Fade(in,2.4,#FFFFFF)@1;

          CamOffset(0,5,0.1)@0.1;

          required
          CamOffset(reset,3)@2;

          PFace(left);

          PAttack(left,0.5)@2->m(1);

          PAttack(left,0.5)@m(1)->m(2);

          PAttack(left,0.5)@m(2)->m(3);

          PAttack(left,0.5)@m(3)->m(4);

          PAttack(left)@m(4);'
