      - title: Menu Text
        value: 
        type: 0
        typeString: 
      - title: Dialogue Text
        value: "\u201CMy dear child, I\u2019m sorry I can no longer continue this
          journey by your side.\u201D\n\n\u201CMy duty has come to an end. From here
          on, it is your turn to write your own story.\u201D\n\n\u201CWhen the Month
          of Star\u2019s Return comes to an end this year, make your way to a place
          called Mount Sixiang.\u201D\n\n\u201CThere, the truth of your origins\u2014and
          the purpose you were born to fulfill\u2014will be revealed.\u201D\n\n\u201CTake
          the sword hilt with you. Climb to the summit, and complete the task that
          only you can accomplish.\u201D\n\n\u201CDo not grieve for me. I will return
          to the Root of the World with the Waters of Wuji.\u201D\n\n\u201CI will
          become Qi itself\u2026 and bear witness to your destiny.\u201D"
        type: 0
        typeString: 
